    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald is delighted to present 9A Thomas Court, a well-maintained one-bedroom apartment ideally positioned in the heart of Dublin 8. Extending to approximately 34 sq.m / 366 sq.ft, this compact yet practical home benefits from its own private rear garden, a rare feature in such a central city location.\n\nThe accommodation is thoughtfully laid out and comprises an entrance hallway leading to all principal rooms. The double bedroom overlooks the front and features fitted storage, carpet flooring and an electric heater. Adjacent is the bathroom, fitted with an electric power shower, WC and wash hand basin, complemented by tiled finishes.\n\nTo the rear lies a bright and generously proportioned living room with wooden flooring, a feature fireplace and additional storage. The kitchen is accessed directly from the living area and is fitted with floor and wall units, tiled splashback, electric cooker with extractor hood, washing machine and stainless-steel sink.\n\nA standout feature of the property is the private rear garden, enclosed by high boundary walls which provide an excellent sense of privacy and seclusion despite its city centre setting. The low-maintenance outdoor space offers an ideal spot for relaxing or al fresco dining.\n\nThe location is second to none, with Dublin city centre within easy walking distance and a wealth of amenities on the doorstep, including cafés, restaurants, shops, universities and cultural attractions. Excellent public transport links, including multiple Dublin Bus routes and the LUAS Red Line, provide convenient access throughout the city and beyond."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHallway - 1.57m x 1.72m\nLeading from the front door to the bedroom, bathroom and living area\n\nBedroom - 2.40m x 3.58m\nentering from the hallway, sizeable double bedroom with window to front aspect decorated with curtains, carpet flooring, wall mounted electric heater, and large built in storage\n\nBathroom - 1.37m x 2.63m\nfollowing on from the bedroom, the bathroom contains standing electric power shower, tiled floor and shower wall, traditional toilet with cistern, ceramic sink with mixer taps\n\nLiving Room - 3.83m x 4.34m\nthe generously sized living area, with feature fireplace, wooden floor, additional storage, with wall mounted radiator\n\nKitchen - 2.51m x 1.32m\nconnected from the living room, the modest kitchen contains tiled flooring and splashback, a window to rear aspect, built in washing machine and electric cooker with overhead extractor, stainless steel with inset mixer taps, overhead storage\n\nOutisde - \nfollowing from the living room into the low maintenance rear garden, high walls offering privacy in the heart of the city, sole ownershipThe front of the building provided on street permit parking\n\n"
      },
